OL,3,GNEWSAAxing of bus service has caused
OL,4,Achaos, parents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have said the the removal of a
OL,7,Fbus service for students trying to get
OL,8,Fto college has led to "chaos."
OL,10,FSince the start of the new academic
OL,11,Fyear, Truro & Penwith College is no
OL,12,Flonger providing a tendered bus service
OL,13,Ffor students living in Falmouth.
OL,15,FStudents affected were advised to use
OL,16,Flocal trains instead - with free
OL,17,Fshuttle buses then available between
OL,18,FTruro rail station and the college's
OL,19,Fcampus.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
